<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" lang="fa" dir="rtl">
  <head>
    <title>کاریزما، شکست‌ناپذیر!</title>

    <%- include('partials/meta.ejs'); %> <%- include('partials/link.ejs'); %>
    <%- include('partials/style.ejs'); %> <%- include('partials/ga.ejs'); %>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-white font-yekanBakh">
    <nav class="relative bg-white shadow-lg px-5 md:px-20">
      <div class="container mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
        <div class="text-xl font-bold">
          <a
            href="/"
            onclick="this.href += window.location.search"
            class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800"
          >
            <img
              src="<%=domainURL%>/images/nav-logo.png?ver=<%=version%>"
              alt="logo"
              height="100"
              width="100"
              class="h-20 w-20"
            />
          </a>
        </div>
        <div
          class="flex-1 justify-center items-center gap-6 text-center hidden md:flex"
        >
          <a
            href="https://domestos.ir/"
            target="_blank"
            class="text-black font-bold text-md hover:text-[#007537]"
            >درباره کاریزما</a
          >
          <a
            href="#section-3"
            class="text-black font-bold text-md hover:text-[#007537]"
            >بازی کن و برنده شو</a
          >
          <a
            href="#section-4"
            class="text-black font-bold text-md hover:text-[#007537]"
            >سفارش محصول</a
          >
        </div>
        <a
          href="/main"
          onclick="this.href += window.location.search"
          class="block relative w-36 h-[70px] bg-no-repeat bg-contain"
          style="
            background-image: url(<%=domainURL%>/images/nav-button.png?ver=<%=version%>);
          "
        ></a>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <main class="">
      <!-- Banner Section -->
      <section
        id="section-1"
        class="bg-no-repeat bg-contain w-full aspect-[1440/968]"
        style="
          background-image: url(<%=domainURL%>/images/banner.png?ver=<%=version%>);
        "
      ></section>
      <section
        id="section-2"
        class="relative z-10 bg-no-repeat bg-contain w-full aspect-[1440/390] text-center bg-center rounded-t-[40px] xl:rounded-t-[90px] -mt-12 xl:-mt-24"
        style="
          background-image: radial-gradient(
            76.32% 72.97% at 50% 100%,
            #9ae6ff 0%,
            #ffffff 100%
          );
          background-size: 100% 100%;
        "
      >
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 bg-no-repeat bg-contain bg-center"
          style="
            background-image: url(<%=domainURL%>/images/product-info.png?ver=<%=version%>);
            background-size: 85%;
            background-position: center 30%;
          "
        ></div>
      </section>
      <!-- Second Section -->
      <section
        id="section-3"
        class="relative flex flex-col z-20 justify-between items-center bg-no-repeat bg-contain w-full aspect-[1440/1104] text-center rounded-t-[40px] xl:rounded-t-[90px] -mt-4 xl:-mt-20"
        style="
          background-image: url(<%=domainURL%>/images/section2.png?ver=<%=version%>);
        "
      >
        <!--            <p class="w-full text-center text-[#3F4A46] font-bold text-[1rem] sm:text-[1.6rem] md:text-[2.3rem] lg:text-[2.9rem] xl:text-[3.5rem] tracking-tighter pt-8 sm:pt-11 md:pt-15 lg:pt-20 xl:pt-24 clear-both">بازی کن،</p>-->
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <p
            class="w-full text-center text-[#fff] font-bold text-[1.3rem] sm:text-[2.1rem] md:text-[3.5rem] lg:text-[4rem] xl:text-[4.5rem] tracking-tighter pt-1 xl:pt-3"
          >
            بازی کن و برنده شو!
          </p>
          <p
            class="w-full text-center text-[#fff] mt-1 sm:mt-1 lg:mt-10 xl:mt-20 text-[0.7rem] sm:text-[0.7rem] md:text-[1.1rem] lg:text-[1.4rem] xl:text-[1.5rem] pt-1 px-2"
          >
            کاریزما ۲x۱ رو بردار و با میکروب‌زدایی و جلوگیری از تشکیل جرم و
            رسوب، شانس برنده شدن جایزه‌ها رو به دست بیار
          </p>
          <ul
            class="w-full list-disc flex flex-row justify-around font-bold text-center text-[#fff] mt-1 lg:mt-2 text-[0.7rem] sm:text-[0.7rem] md:text-[1.1rem] lg:text-[1.2rem] xl:text-[1.3rem] pt-1"
          >
            <li>پلی‌استیشن ۵</li>
            <li>آیفون ۱۶ پرو</li>
            <li>ایرفرایر نینجا</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!--            <p class="w-full text-center text-[#1D2C24] font-black text-[2.3rem] sm:text-[3.1rem] md:text-[4.5rem] lg:text-[5rem] xl:text-[6.5rem] tracking-tighter drop-shadow-[-1.86px_3.71px_0px_rgba(255,255,255,0.96)]">برنـــده شو!</p>-->
        <div
          class="w-full flex justify-center mb-[5%] h-[20%] md:h-[12%] lg:h-[9%]"
        >
          <a
            id="cta"
            href="/main"
            onclick="this.href += window.location.search"
            class="flex bg-no-repeat bg-contain bg-center h-full w-full"
            style="
              background-image: url(<%=domainURL%>/images/nav-button.png?ver=<%=version%>);
            "
          ></a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Product Section -->
      <section
        id="section-4"
        class="w-full bg-white flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center gap-8 px-8 lg:px-[15%] !pb-16"
        style="
          background: radial-gradient(
            194.95% 186.41% at 52.15% 213.44%,
            #9ae6ff 0%,
            #ffffff 100%
          );
        "
      >
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col relative">
          <div
            class="flex w-full justify-center aspect-[625/695] bg-center bg-no-repeat bg-contain text-center"
            style="
              background-image: url(<%=domainURL%>/images/product.png?ver=<%=version%>);
            "
          >
            <!-- <a
              class="flex flex-1 justify-center itmes-center text-[#007537] font-bold text-lg lg:text-xl py-3 px-3 border border-[#007535] bg-transparent hover:bg-[#007537] hover:text-white rounded-[26px] text-center mt-8 m-auto"
              href="https://www.digikala.com/fresh/product/dkp-17943617/"
              target="_blank"
            >
              <img
                src="/images/digi-logo.png"
                alt="digi-logo"
                style="height: 100%; width: 90%"
              />
            </a>
            <a
              class="flex flex-1 justify-center itmes-center text-[#007537] font-bold text-lg lg:text-xl py-3 px-3 border border-[#007535] bg-transparent hover:bg-[#007537] hover:text-white rounded-[26px] text-center mt-8 m-auto"
              href="http://d.snpx.link/sxy"
              target="_blank"
            >
              <img
                src="/images/snapp-logo.png"
                alt="digi-logo"
                style="height: 100%; width: 50%"
              />
            </a> -->
            <div
              class="flex flex-1 absolute w-[83%] h-[7.5%] bottom-[16.5%] justify-between items-center gap-4"
            >
              <a
                class="flex flex-1 h-full w-[50%] mr-[3%] justify-center items-center text-[#0A1E6C] font-bold text-sm lg:text-xl py-[3%] px-[4%] border border-[#0A1E6C] bg-transparent hover:bg-[#0A1E6C] hover:text-white rounded-[26px] text-center m-auto"
                href="https://digikala.com/brand/domestos"
                target="_blank"
              >
                خرید از دیجی‌کالا
              </a>
              <a
                class="flex flex-1 h-full w-[50%] justify-center items-center text-[#0A1E6C] font-bold text-sm lg:text-xl py-[3%] px-[4%] border border-[#0A1E6C] bg-transparent hover:bg-[#0A1E6C] hover:text-white rounded-[26px] text-center m-auto"
                href="https://d.snpx.link/r394"
                target="_blank"
              >
                خرید از اسنپ
              </a>
            </div>
            <div
              class="flex flex-1 absolute w-[43%] h-[7.5%] mr-[3%] bottom-[7.7%] justify-between items-center gap-4"
            >
              <a
                class="flex flex-1 h-full w-[50%] justify-center items-center text-[#0A1E6C] font-bold text-sm lg:text-xl py-[3%] px-[4%] border border-[#0A1E6C] bg-transparent hover:bg-[#0A1E6C] hover:text-white rounded-[26px] text-center m-auto"
                href="https://www.tapsi.markets/brands/Damestos"
                target="_blank"
              >
                خرید از تپسی
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col relative justify-center items-center">
          <div
            class="flex flex-col flex-1 justify-center items-center"
            dir="rtl"
          >
            <h4 class="w-full font-bold text-2xl lg:text-3xl mb-6">توضیحات</h4>
            <ul
              class="w-full list-disc pr-6 text-[1rem] sm:text-[1rem] md:text-[1.1rem] lg:text-[1.2rem] xl:text-[1.3rem]"
              style="line-height: 2"
            >
              <li>سفیدکننده غلیظ و قدرتمند</li>
              <li>تا ۳ برابر جلوگیری از تشکیل جرم و رسوبات</li>
              <li>میکروب‌زدا و لکه‌بر قوی</li>
              <li>
                قابل‌استفاده برای سطوح مختلف سرویس بهداشتی، آشپزخانه و حتی
                شست‌و‌شوی لباس های سفید
              </li>
              <li>دارای رایحه کاج</li>
              <li>حجم ۵۰۰ میلی‌لیتر</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="flex bg-white mx-6 text-center text-gray-500 border-t">
      <div class="text-xl font-bold">
        <a
          href="/"
          onclick="this.href += window.location.search"
          class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800"
        >
          <img
            src="<%=domainURL%>/images/footer-logo.png?ver=<%=version%>"
            alt="logo"
            height="100"
            width="100"
          />
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-1 justify-end items-center gap-6 text-center">
        <a
          href="https://domestos.ir/"
          target="_blank"
          class="text-black font-normal opacity-30 text-sm hover:opacity-1"
          >درباره کاریزما</a
        >
        <a
          href="#section-3"
          class="text-black font-normal opacity-30 text-sm hover:opacity-1"
          >بازی کن و برنده شو</a
        >
        <a
          href="#section-4"
          class="text-black font-normal opacity-30 text-sm hover:opacity-1"
          >سفارش محصول</a
        >
      </div>
    </footer>

    <!-- (Optional) Additional Scripts -->
    <script src="<%=domainURL%>/js/jquery.min.js?ver=<%=version%>"></script>
    <script type="text/javascript">
      $(document).on("click", 'a[href^="#"]', function (event) {
        event.preventDefault();

        $("html, body").animate(
          {
            scrollTop: $($.attr(this, "href")).offset().top,
          },
          500
        );
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
